  "description": "Hand-assembled to order at the Fly warehouse and fully customizable following these steps:\n\n1. Select the bike you want using the options available on the website.\n2. Proceed with the order confirmation.\n3. For any specific part change, just write in the comments the part you’d like to replace.\n4. Confirm your order\n\n- Parts with higher price: 30% discount to the individual price difference.\n- Upcharge Payment: Once the order is confirmed, we´ll send you a link to proceed.\n- If the chosen part is not available, we´ll inform you the delivery info.\n- No refunds are issued for parts of lower value.\n\n• The option without brakes does not include any brake hardware.\n• Easy Assembly with our 100% plastic-free recyclable packaging.\n• LHD (Left-Hand Drive) and RHD (Right-Hand Drive):\nWhere the drivetrain is located to protect the chain/sprocket when you grind.\n\nLooking for a pro street BMX to rock your neighborhood? OMEGA is the perfect choice for those who want to ensure high-quality riding, inspired by Courage's setup, this bike is able to reach any street freestyle BMX expectative: no matter which trick you are thinking about. The Omega Street BMX also includes the aftermarket Fly hits that build an authentic top-range bike and some specs like:\n• 100% CrMo Frame, Fork & Bars.\n• Sealed Hubs, Freecoaster or Cassette options.\n• 3 Piece CrMo Crankset with a tough 48-spline spindle.\n...And more!\n\nDue to possible supply-chain issues or shipping delays specs are subject to change without notice. The swap part will always be similar model with the same or even higher quality.",
